{d}^{2}q}{d{t}^{2}}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, by Kirchhoff's voltage law, the differential equation governing the amount of charge $q$ on the capacitor is\n\n$$\n10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)=15\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}+10q+5\\,\\frac{{d}^{2}q}{d{t}^{2}},\n$$\n\nwhich gives\n\n$$\n\\frac{{d}^{2}q}{d{t}^{2}}+3\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}+2q=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t).\n$$" 13194139536073 true] [17592186382358 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382359 13194139536073 true] [17592186382358 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382360 13194139536073 true] [17592186382358 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382361 13194139536073 true] [17592186382358 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382362 13194139536073 true] [17592186382358 1000 #edb/ref 17592186382363 13194139536073 true] [17592186382358 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536073 true] [17592186382358 1041 "selection" 13194139536073 true] [17592186382358 1104 #edb/ref 17592186382363 13194139536073 true] [17592186382358 1110 #uuid "bacc07b3-c950-5470-84e0-d567e26484c5" 13194139536073 true] [17592186382359 1034 "\\frac{{d}^{2}q}{d{t}^{2}}+3\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}+2q=2" 13194139536073 true] [17592186382359 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536073 true] [17592186382359 1111 #uuid "2620791e-c52a-54c7-bd62-e595f17a9c2b" 13194139536073 true] [17592186382360 1034 "\\frac{{d}^{2}q}{d{t}^{2}}+3\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}+\\frac{1}{2}q=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)" 13194139536073 true] [17592186382360 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536073 true] [17592186382360 1111 #uuid "c0c1efa6-29a9-5996-b108-12d506567bca" 13194139536073 true] [17592186382361 1034 "\\frac{{d}^{2}q}{d{t}^{2}}+3\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}+2q=10\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)" 13194139536073 true] [17592186382361 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536073 true] [17592186382361 1111 #uuid "2ffaf9a0-7276-5131-a3ed-809ce4bdec52" 13194139536073 true] [17592186382362 1034 "\\frac{{d}^{2}q}{d{t}^{2}}+\\frac{1}{3}\\,\\frac{dq}{dt}+2q=2\\operatorname{cos}⁡(2t)" 13194139536073 true] [17592186382362 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536073 true] [17592186382362 1111 #uuid "ef6